message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Agents for Nanoindentation (WG4)"
abstract: >-
  A LangGraph multi-agent system for autonomous, objective-driven
  nanoindentation: hypothesis generation, literature retrieval, image-based
  site targeting, measurement planning with human approval gates, and
  analysis, with a built-in instrument simulator.
